# szsdlc-managed files stay LF on every platform. szsdlc's generated-view
# staleness check compares byte content, so a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf is
# true on Windows) would otherwise make `szsdlc validate` report every generated
# view as stale on a fresh clone.
.szsdlc/**            text eol=lf
docs/sdlc/**          text eol=lf
docs/roadmap.md       text eol=lf
docs/requirements.md  text eol=lf
docs/board.md         text eol=lf
docs/decisions.md     text eol=lf
docs/epic-rollup.md   text eol=lf
docs/inbox.md         text eol=lf
docs/tag-index.md     text eol=lf
docs/traceability.md  text eol=lf
